comment;#1: The city does not store ballot-level data. VOTES contain one synthetic row for each project-point entry, so voter_id identifies an entry, not a person or ballot. #2: Unused funds from the three budget categories were pooled to fund additional highest-scoring projects. Projects 114 and 124 are marked with selected=2.
